{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GRID RANGER is a short, 3D shmuplike with laser sharp aesthetics and a retro-futuristic soundtrack.  Dodge and blast your way through 3 super-intense levels (or play in endless mode) and see what lies beyond the grid...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964400/extras/08332d95f816dac221fab4df42e787f8.poster.avif?t=1763998218\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964400/extras/08332d95f816dac221fab4df42e787f8.webm?t=1763998218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964400/extras/08332d95f816dac221fab4df42e787f8.mp4?t=1763998218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level starts with a  high-speed racing zone, followed by a slower arcade zone, and ends with a powerful guardian:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964400/extras/5904dfa084f339a6dc31ca088d7d1515.poster.avif?t=1763998218\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964400/extras/5904dfa084f339a6dc31ca088d7d1515.webm?t=1763998218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964400/extras/5904dfa084f339a6dc31ca088d7d1515.mp4?t=1763998218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grid Ranger is a small-scope project and is priced accordingly. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional info:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Mouse-oriented controls</strong> for extra precision (The CNTRL option adjusts sensitivity). Game pads are also supported, but not recommended.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Uses the <strong>V99 vector engine</strong> (like its sister game UTOPIA MUST FALL) for a clean &amp; classic look</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>3 levels total</strong>, each increasing in difficulty, to reach insane levels of intensity by the very end</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 modes of <strong>difficulty</strong>: Normal and Hardcore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite mode</strong>: a never ending level that gets increasingly fast and difficult</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 8 original tracks by Miles Tilmann, composer for NOVA DRIFT </p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Quatrakiller","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2964400/6586d8bf1b76b88d02d253b13739764fb42daac8.jpg"},{"name":"Tristrangulator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2964400/45ad013c76a1f52ef150178fc250aea948832a01.jpg"},{"name":"Escapee","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2964400/a5c7e0e0e44023d392b63f7c9a50593a36022898.jpg"},{"name":"Hardcore Quatrakiller","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2964400/b77aad14c46b5915851ea0be2cabf7d6fb23ccad.jpg"},{"name":"Hardcore Tristrangulator ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2964400/b1fca16623bc243f9b2a79a44e77e8c416ddc171.jpg"},{"name":"Hardcore Escapee","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2964400/b0fc9c655ad336c12b0c99ca8c206cff175c1e82.jpg"},{"name":"Gridmaster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/296440